{"title": "Umbral Influx (Condition)", "pageid": 40567, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Umbral_Influx_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has tick type", "Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grappled Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Grappled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Umbral Influx</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Tendrils of shadow engulf the corpse, until it becomes unclear where the body ends and the shadows begin. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: end of turn\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/ApplyToDead\" title=\"Status properties/ApplyToDead\">ApplyToDead</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Shadow-Cursed_Undead\">Condition: Shadow-Cursed Undead</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Undead (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow-Cursed Undead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Undead_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Undead (Condition)\">Shadow-Cursed Undead</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Those who die in the shadows are cursed to remain there forever.</li>\n<li>These undead have reduced <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a>, are <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Types\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Types\">Resistant</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage and cannot use <a href=\"/wiki/Spell\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell\">Spells</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_Actions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Actions\">Weapon Actions</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Umbral_Influx\">Sources of Umbral Influx</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"min-width: 30px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Curse (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Curse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Shadow_Curse_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Curse_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Curse (Condition)\">Shadow Curse</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714221044\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1611/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 22101/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5403/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 977169/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   49.213      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   49.213      1 -total\n 56.72%   27.913      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 35.39%   17.414      2 Template:Condition_sour